{"id":"sevt_chg0017","processed_at":"2026-11-11T10:00:25.500000Z","type":"agent.custom_tool_use","name":"show_plan","input":{"summary":"Penguin Catch, now with a red scarf on the penguin.","controls":"Stick: slide left and right. START: play.","top_rules":["R12","R2","R4","R3"],"rules":[{"id":"R1","kind":"auto","text":"Left and right make the penguin speed up and slide like on ice. When you let go it keeps sliding for a while. It stops at the screen edges."},{"id":"R2","kind":"auto","text":"Catching a fish makes it vanish and gives you 10 points."},{"id":"R3","kind":"auto","text":"You start with 3 lives. If a fish hits the ice, you lose a life."},{"id":"R4","kind":"auto","text":"Catching a boot makes it vanish and costs you a life. No points."},{"id":"R5","kind":"auto","text":"If a boot hits the ice, nothing bad happens."},{"id":"R6","kind":"auto","text":"With 0 lives left, the game-over screen shows and nothing more falls."},{"id":"R7","kind":"auto","text":"Things fall faster and faster as you play, up to a top speed."},{"id":"R8","kind":"auto","text":"The first 3 things are always fish. After that, boots show up sometimes, and more often the longer you play."},{"id":"R9","kind":"auto","text":"Things start falling more often the longer you play."},{"id":"R10","kind":"auto","text":"START on the title starts a game. START on game over goes back to the title."},{"id":"R11","kind":"auto","text":"Your best score is saved and shown on the title screen."},{"id":"R12","kind":"you-check","text":"The penguin wears a red scarf you can see while it slides.","was":"The penguin looks like a penguin, and sliding feels slippery and fun."},{"id":"R13","kind":"you-check","text":"Boots look very different from fish, so you can tell them apart."},{"id":"R14","kind":"you-check","text":"The penguin does a happy hop for a fish, and an ouch flash for a boot, with sounds."}],"changes":[{"id":"R12","text":"The penguin wears a red scarf now."}]}}
